sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer (web)
    participant BS as BookingServlet
    participant CS as ChargingService
    participant QS as QueueService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant QP as QueueProcessor thread
    actor O as Operator (desktop)
    C->>BS: POST /customer/book (action=now)
    BS->>CS: chargeNow(customer, vehicle, station, FAST, soc)
    CS->>DB: SELECT free FAST chargers ... FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>CS: none free
    CS->>QS: joinQueue(...)
    QS->>QS: estimateWait() using PriorityQueue
    QS->>DB: INSERT queue_entries / notifications
    QS-->>BS: QueueEntry(position, est. wait)
    BS-->>C: "Added to queue, wait ~43 min"
    O->>CS: stopSession(sessionId)
    CS->>DB: UPDATE session, charger AVAILABLE, INSERT payment (one transaction)
    CS->>QP: wakeUp()
    QP->>QS: processQueue()
    QS->>DB: find free charger, mark entry ALLOCATED
    QS->>CS: startSession(queued vehicle)
    QS->>DB: INSERT notification "allocated to charger"
    O-->>O: dashboard shows notification
